SUMMARY:Dream Outside the Box: Fingerprint Detectives Volunteering at MacGr
 egor
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:MacGregor
DESCRIPTION:Volunteer session where kids act as forensic scientists: they l
 ift their own fingerprints with pencil and tape\, solve 'Who took the cook
 ie?' by matching prints to volunteer suspect cards\, and transfer a finger
 print onto a balloon. Run of show: welcome 3:15\, lift prints 3:25\, cooki
 e case 3:40\, balloon print 3:50\, show-and-tell and clean up 4:00. Set up
  before 3:15 with tape\, pencils\, scrap paper\, index cards (2 per kid)\,
  magnifiers\, wipes\, cookie jar print\, and balloons\; one volunteer per 
 table. Balloons are latex\, so ask about allergies\, blow them up for K-1 
 students\, and pick up popped pieces immediately.\nHost: Dream Outside the
  Box\nRSVP requested by Sun Nov 8\, 11:59 PM: https://forms.gle/7i4zqoYMLk
 wWFk2L6\nDetails: https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/ev
